The Suzuri theme family is ported from Visual Studio Code's built-in
"Light 2026" and "Dark 2026" default themes.

Source: https://github.com/microsoft/vscode
        extensions/theme-defaults/themes/2026-light.json
        extensions/theme-defaults/themes/2026-dark.json

